NAME
       watch - run a command repeatedly

SYNOPSIS
       watch [-n seconds] command [args...]

DESCRIPTION
       Clears the screen and reruns COMMAND every two seconds, so a
       changing value can be followed. Press Ctrl-C to stop.

OPTIONS
       -n S   wait S seconds between runs

EXAMPLES
       watch -n 1 ifconfig
       watch lsblk

SEE ALSO
       top(1), sysmon(1)
